### Authorization requirements

Only support downloading when the source and content permissions allow it.

Do not bypass DRM, authentication, private-content restrictions, paywalls, or platform download restrictions.

Do not build an unauthorized Instagram downloader.

Prefer official download endpoints, openly licensed media, user-owned files, and sources that explicitly permit downloading.

