- featured: boolean, default false.
- visibility: draft or published.
- metadata_source: text, nullable.
- metadata_source_id: text, nullable.
- created_at: timestamp.
- updated_at: timestamp.

Use an appropriate unique constraint for metadata source identifiers.

### genres

- id: UUID primary key.
- name: unique text.
- slug: unique text.

### anime_genres

- anime_id: foreign key.
- genre_id: foreign key.
